R33 — PS3 `RW4ps3` texture-descriptor census over the loose `rendering/**/*.rpsgl` trees (NHL 11 / 14 / 15 / Legacy have full loose trees;
08–10 / 12 / 13 only a few loose files), read-only. Descriptor = 0x38 bytes (14 big-endian words) at the `00 02 00 03` file-table entries;
Studio reads +32..43 (format signature), +48 u16 width, +50 u16 height, +52 u8 mips. Here every word is censused per shape
(width, height, signature, mips) so the writer can see which of the 14 words vary with the dimensions (pitch / size / remap words of the
RSX texture header, if any) and which are constant; the data slots (`00 01 00 30`) are checked against `w*h*4` (ARGB) or the DXT chain sum.
Usage: python r33_rw4ps3_descriptor_census.py <out.json> [--titles nhl11,legacy] [--max N]
